WEBVTT

00:00:15.330 --> 00:00:19.250
All things considered,
these have grown into having good skin color.

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:22.580
Yum!

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:25.580
I wouldn't be ashamed
to sell these anywhere!

00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:28.630
Yeah, vegetables are the best after all.

00:00:28.630 --> 00:00:32.080
If I take care of them,
they'll respond in kind as much as I did.

00:00:45.880 --> 00:00:51.750
I started doing farm work to help out Al-kun,
but this in itself is kind of becoming fun!

00:00:51.750 --> 00:00:52.920
That's true.

00:00:52.920 --> 00:00:58.290
I didn't know the vegetables I was usually eating
were made in this way.

00:00:58.290 --> 00:01:02.830
You use muscles that you don't usually use,
so you get to train your body too.

00:01:02.830 --> 00:01:05.830
Stare...

00:01:08.040 --> 00:01:09.710
Stare...

00:01:12.380 --> 00:01:16.710
By the way, I've been a little curious,
but what's with those pendants?

00:01:16.880 --> 00:01:19.880
Oh, this? We got them from Al.

00:01:20.210 --> 00:01:23.960
He said it has a calming effect
and wards off evil.

00:01:23.960 --> 00:01:26.460
With Al-kun, the three of us have matching sets.

00:01:26.460 --> 00:01:28.040
What's with that?! No fair!

00:01:30.380 --> 00:01:32.920
Al-kun also has one of those, right?

00:01:32.920 --> 00:01:36.330
In that case, if I receive it from Al-kun,
then that'll make it equal.

00:01:36.330 --> 00:01:37.580
You can't!

00:01:37.580 --> 00:01:41.880
This is kind of like a reward
for the time we helped Al at Gull Town.

00:01:41.880 --> 00:01:43.000
She's right.

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:47.000
You also have to think of Linea-san's feelings,
since she gave that to Al-kun.

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:50.250
Who's Linea?! Another new woman?!

00:01:50.250 --> 00:01:52.540
Al-kun is always like that anyway!

00:01:52.540 --> 00:01:58.000
He goes to places on adventures and
becomes friends with a new girl right away!

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:00.000
That's for sure...

00:02:00.170 --> 00:02:02.080
It's the usual routine, you know?

00:02:02.670 --> 00:02:06.920
It looks like it's about time that Al-kun
should make things clear for once!

00:02:07.080 --> 00:02:10.040
Hold on a sec.
We prohibited any unfair beating to the punch.

00:02:10.040 --> 00:02:12.670
Al-kun's feelings are
the most important, you know?

00:02:12.790 --> 00:02:14.830
I-I know that.

00:02:14.830 --> 00:02:19.080
But if we relax our guard,
he'll meet another new girl,

00:02:19.080 --> 00:02:20.710
or get attacked by a demon-

00:02:29.670 --> 00:02:32.500
Growing up Growing up

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:35.460
If the light shines

00:02:35.460 --> 00:02:39.750
I'm sure I can encounter the real me

00:02:39.750 --> 00:02:44.290
Whom I didn't know about

00:02:52.630 --> 00:02:57.540
Our Story was born on an earth

00:02:57.540 --> 00:03:03.420
That has forgotten its brilliance

00:03:03.710 --> 00:03:09.130
So that the future waiting

00:03:09.130 --> 00:03:17.250
Beyond the many encounters and hopes is filled with light

00:03:17.500 --> 00:03:20.540
Let's go jump over the darkness

00:03:20.540 --> 00:03:23.540
If you're the same, then reach out

00:03:23.540 --> 00:03:26.250
Rather than looking for a way out

00:03:26.250 --> 00:03:28.960
Knock on a new door

00:03:28.960 --> 00:03:31.880
Exposed to a joyful rain

00:03:31.880 --> 00:03:35.000
Life circles around and will probably sprout up

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:37.630
The overflowing Sunshine breaks through the clouds

00:03:37.630 --> 00:03:40.670
Going beyond without hesitation

00:03:40.670 --> 00:03:43.920
Oh Growing up Growing up

00:03:43.920 --> 00:03:46.750
If the light shines

00:03:46.750 --> 00:03:51.210
I'm sure I can encounter the real me

00:03:51.210 --> 00:03:56.040
Whom I didn't know about

00:03:59.460 --> 00:04:00.750
What's wrong, Al-kun?!

00:04:00.750 --> 00:04:03.420
Don't tell me, did a new demon actually...

00:04:00.880 --> 00:04:03.500
<b>The Farmer and the Reunion at the Demon King Castle</b>

00:04:05.290 --> 00:04:06.920
Take a look!

00:04:09.750 --> 00:04:11.290
At what?

00:04:12.080 --> 00:04:13.920
It's a bushgiller!

00:04:13.920 --> 00:04:15.420
Bush-what?

00:04:15.420 --> 00:04:17.040
It's a bushgiller!

00:04:17.040 --> 00:04:19.710
This bastard can't be exterminated
with just a little bit of effort.

00:04:19.710 --> 00:04:22.630
And if you ignore it, it freely sucks up
the nutrients of the surrounding vegetables,

00:04:22.630 --> 00:04:24.790
so it's the worst plant of all!

00:04:26.330 --> 00:04:29.790
That I hadn't notice until it had multiplied this much,
means I let my guard down!

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:37.750
So mad at myself! So frustrating!
For Al-kun, more than the demonkind,<b>
</b>his number one enemy is weeds, you know?<b></b>

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:40.080
So mad at myself! So frustrating!
At this rate, he's not even<b>
</b>thinking about girls, you know?<b></b>

00:04:40.080 --> 00:04:40.790
At this rate, he's not even
thinking about girls, you know?

00:04:42.630 --> 00:04:46.460
C'mon! They're cheap and delicious!
These are the best vegetables!

00:04:46.460 --> 00:04:48.040
Welcome!
Welcome! This way! How about these?<b></b>

00:04:48.040 --> 00:04:49.080
Oh, you there!
Welcome! This way! How about these?<b></b>

00:04:49.080 --> 00:04:51.630
Now then, please feel free to just take a look!

00:04:51.630 --> 00:04:55.580
They're sweet and delicious, and these vegetables
are good for beauty and for health!

00:04:55.920 --> 00:04:58.330
I'd like three of these tomatas, please.

00:04:58.330 --> 00:04:59.580
Sure, thank you as always!

00:04:59.920 --> 00:05:02.080
I'll throw in an ashparagus for free too!

00:05:02.710 --> 00:05:04.500
Here are the tomatas and ashparagus.

00:05:04.500 --> 00:05:05.960
Thank you.

00:05:07.670 --> 00:05:09.460
Thank you very much, as always.

00:05:09.460 --> 00:05:10.710
Yo, Al.

00:05:10.710 --> 00:05:13.500
Oh! Jake-san! It's been a while!

00:05:13.710 --> 00:05:16.380
It looks like business is thriving as usual.

00:05:16.380 --> 00:05:19.380
Please pack up those lemins
and carrods for me.

00:05:19.380 --> 00:05:23.500
You see, ever since I started buying your vegetables,
I've been into cooking for myself.

00:05:23.500 --> 00:05:24.750
Thanks as always!

00:05:24.750 --> 00:05:27.250
In that case, please take
this cabbash with you too.

00:05:28.250 --> 00:05:29.460
Thanks for that.

00:05:29.750 --> 00:05:32.790
And more importantly,
please show up to the guild too.

00:05:32.790 --> 00:05:35.830
Lamia and Luke have both
been wanting to have drinks with you.

00:05:35.830 --> 00:05:36.670
Sure.

00:05:36.670 --> 00:05:40.750
It's just that I kind of have pressing business
to attend to after this, so maybe next time.

00:05:40.750 --> 00:05:43.880
That's too bad. Well, see ya.

00:05:45.460 --> 00:05:48.880
They're cheap and delicious!
These are the best vegetables!

00:05:48.880 --> 00:05:51.000
How about some delicious vegetables?!

00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:56.080
Huh?! Oh, this is a surprise.

00:05:56.080 --> 00:05:58.210
What is going on with that disguise?

00:05:59.330 --> 00:06:04.290
I am a normal customer who has come
to buy your vegetables, what about it?

00:06:04.290 --> 00:06:09.330
A normal customer wouldn't refer to
themselves as a normal customer, you know...

00:06:09.330 --> 00:06:11.290
So, what would you like?

00:06:11.290 --> 00:06:14.540
Well, I'll take all that you have
of the daipon radish.

00:06:14.540 --> 00:06:16.670
The daipon...

00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:19.880
There are only two left, so I'll pack up both, okay?

00:06:19.880 --> 00:06:21.290
Thanks as always!

00:06:22.330 --> 00:06:26.460
By the way, Al, when will you
be joining our family?

00:06:26.460 --> 00:06:29.540
Even though the fields and a wife
have all been prepared and ready for you.

00:06:29.540 --> 00:06:33.790
As I already told you, I am not thinking
of undertaking those kinds of things.

00:06:33.790 --> 00:06:36.460
All right, then I'll add on the farmland
on the east side as well.

00:06:36.880 --> 00:06:37.710
Grr...

00:06:37.710 --> 00:06:41.580
Furthermore, I will provide you
with newly developed farming tools!

00:06:41.580 --> 00:06:43.830
Farmland! Farming tools!

00:06:46.170 --> 00:06:47.710
Al, snap out of it!

00:06:47.710 --> 00:06:51.330
You can't be tempted by farming tools
into marrying someone you don't even like!  

00:06:58.250 --> 00:07:00.420
Al? Al?!

00:07:00.710 --> 00:07:02.330
Oops...

00:07:02.330 --> 00:07:04.420
Al!

00:07:04.920 --> 00:07:06.710
Al Wayne...

00:07:08.580 --> 00:07:10.500
Al Wayne...

00:07:10.500 --> 00:07:13.920
Al Wayne, can you hear me?

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:16.750
Huh?

00:07:18.830 --> 00:07:20.130
I...

00:07:22.460 --> 00:07:25.540
am... your...

00:07:26.790 --> 00:07:29.000
What? What was that?

00:07:29.380 --> 00:07:30.750
Not yet...

00:07:31.750 --> 00:07:34.080
Eventually... we shall...

00:07:35.960 --> 00:07:37.000
Wait!

00:07:41.880 --> 00:07:45.500
Oh, you've come to. I was worried.

00:07:47.420 --> 00:07:49.500
Wh-what was that just now?

00:07:49.710 --> 00:07:50.830
What's wrong?

00:07:51.460 --> 00:07:53.040
Oh, excuse me.

00:07:53.040 --> 00:07:55.500
Anyway, in regard to that topic,
some other time perhaps.

00:07:55.790 --> 00:07:57.630
I guess I have no choice...

00:07:58.710 --> 00:08:02.080
Well then, we shall discuss once again
some other time.

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:03.750
See you, Al-dono.

00:08:07.670 --> 00:08:10.380
Now then... Everything sold well.

00:08:10.380 --> 00:08:12.080
Thank you, you two.

00:08:12.080 --> 00:08:13.920
Nah, don't mention it.

00:08:13.920 --> 00:08:18.540
If there is anything I can do,
don't hesitate to ask me anytime, okay?

00:08:18.540 --> 00:08:19.460
Me too.

00:08:19.460 --> 00:08:21.790
I'm okay with stuff other
than adventuring too, okay?

00:08:21.790 --> 00:08:25.290
That is... I want to be of help to you, Al...

00:08:25.500 --> 00:08:26.960
That really helps.

00:08:26.960 --> 00:08:31.540
Well then, I'm going to use this money to go buy
the herbicide for the bushgiller and head home.

00:08:35.500 --> 00:08:36.540
Huh?

00:08:37.000 --> 00:08:39.750
Gonna do it... I'm gonna get them...

00:08:39.750 --> 00:08:43.330
Just you wait, you fiendish bushgiller bastards!

00:08:43.580 --> 00:08:46.080
Uh... Yeah. Good luck...

00:08:46.080 --> 00:08:48.960
I think I'll drop by the guild.

00:08:48.960 --> 00:08:51.500
I did promise to have tea with Helen-san, so...

00:08:51.500 --> 00:08:53.250
Oh! I'll go too!

00:08:53.250 --> 00:08:55.580
Well, Al-kun, see ya.

00:08:55.580 --> 00:08:58.380
Gonna do it... Yeah, gonna do it...

00:08:58.380 --> 00:09:00.080
I'm gonna get them...

00:09:04.250 --> 00:09:05.130
All right!

00:09:05.130 --> 00:09:07.750
With that, I'm done with
today's portion of deliveries.

00:09:11.080 --> 00:09:13.250
Hey! Al-san, it's you.

00:09:13.250 --> 00:09:15.330
It's unusual for you to be in town.

00:09:15.920 --> 00:09:17.080
What?

00:09:17.460 --> 00:09:20.040
What's going on?
You've got that grim look.

00:09:20.250 --> 00:09:24.170
Oh, it's you, Reaks.
Actually, things are really bad.

00:09:24.170 --> 00:09:26.880
I've got bushgillers growing in the fields.

00:09:27.210 --> 00:09:31.380
Oh, you see, bushgillers can't be exterminated
with just a little bit of effort.

00:09:31.380 --> 00:09:34.920
And if you ignore it, then it freely sucks up
the nutrients of the surrounding vegetables,

00:09:34.920 --> 00:09:36.670
so it's the worst plant of all!

00:09:36.670 --> 00:09:37.630
However!

00:09:37.630 --> 00:09:38.380
Huh?!

00:09:38.540 --> 00:09:41.130
If I have this herbicide,
they'll be beaten hands down!

00:09:41.130 --> 00:09:43.380
Just you wait, you bushgiller bastards!

00:09:43.630 --> 00:09:45.380
I-is that so?

00:09:45.380 --> 00:09:46.330
Let go!

00:09:47.130 --> 00:09:48.330
Let me go!
Stop fighting!<b></b>

00:09:48.330 --> 00:09:49.130
Stop fighting!

00:09:49.880 --> 00:09:50.750
Why, you...!

00:09:50.750 --> 00:09:52.170
Don't injure her.

00:09:52.170 --> 00:09:53.540
Little girls sell for a high price, you know.

00:09:53.540 --> 00:09:54.580
Stop it!
Little girls sell for a high price, you know.<b></b>

00:09:54.580 --> 00:09:55.130
Yessir!

00:09:55.130 --> 00:09:56.380
C'mon, stay still!

00:09:56.380 --> 00:09:59.130
In a busy street like this...
Could he be a slave trader?

00:10:00.420 --> 00:10:02.000
What are you guys doing?

00:10:02.460 --> 00:10:03.630
What's that?

00:10:03.630 --> 00:10:06.040
That child doesn't like
what you're doing, you know?

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:07.710
Hey, c'mon, mister.

00:10:07.710 --> 00:10:10.750
Don't poke your nose into something
that's none of your business.

00:10:10.750 --> 00:10:12.290
Or else...

00:10:12.580 --> 00:10:13.960
you'll die before your time!

00:10:17.040 --> 00:10:18.170
You bastard!

00:10:19.630 --> 00:10:20.750
Whoa, whoa...

00:10:27.330 --> 00:10:29.250
Now then, what's left is...

00:10:29.250 --> 00:10:30.130
Huh?!

00:10:38.290 --> 00:10:39.380
Are you okay?

00:10:41.500 --> 00:10:42.790
Those horns...

00:10:43.290 --> 00:10:44.790
A demon child?

00:10:47.420 --> 00:10:49.710
Could you be... Yuria-sama?

00:10:50.170 --> 00:10:52.710
What? You know who I am?

00:10:52.710 --> 00:10:53.830
Of course.

00:10:55.920 --> 00:10:57.880
I am Reaks Bowen.

00:10:58.330 --> 00:11:00.170
You see, we are the same demonkind.

00:11:00.380 --> 00:11:03.210
Still, even though you say
"the same demonkind"...

00:11:03.380 --> 00:11:06.210
This girl is Yuria Macbeth Fongate-sama.

00:11:06.500 --> 00:11:08.170
The only daughter of the Demon King.

00:11:08.670 --> 00:11:10.790
And she is the next head
of the demon kind territory.

00:11:10.790 --> 00:11:12.420
What? The Demon King's?

00:11:12.880 --> 00:11:15.420
Why is someone like her in this town?

00:11:15.750 --> 00:11:17.710
It's all right, Yuria-sama.

00:11:17.710 --> 00:11:20.630
This person doesn't hate demons.

00:11:21.460 --> 00:11:22.630
In that case...

00:11:22.630 --> 00:11:26.250
U-um, I want you to save all of us demons!

00:11:26.580 --> 00:11:27.460
The demons?

00:11:27.920 --> 00:11:30.290
For now, please tell us the details.

00:11:34.670 --> 00:11:39.380
When I was playing in my room,
Volpe Dohma came in suddenly and...

00:11:39.380 --> 00:11:43.540
Oh, you see, Volpe Dohma is
the demon who takes care of me.

00:11:44.170 --> 00:11:46.040
And Volpe Dohma said,

00:11:46.670 --> 00:11:51.000
"You're not safe here. Even if it is just you..."
And after saying that...

00:11:59.420 --> 00:12:03.460
So then, I ended up being
forcibly transferred here...

00:12:05.040 --> 00:12:08.040
I think something terrible happened!

00:12:08.040 --> 00:12:10.630
That's why I have to hurry
and go save them!

00:12:10.790 --> 00:12:12.130
I see...

00:12:12.130 --> 00:12:15.420
But the demonkind territory
is on the other side of the ocean.

00:12:15.420 --> 00:12:18.250
Even if you sailed a boat fast,
it would take at least three days.

00:12:18.630 --> 00:12:20.830
In that case, please leave it to me.

00:12:20.830 --> 00:12:22.290
What? You sure?

00:12:22.290 --> 00:12:24.790
In exchange, Reaks,
I have a favor to ask of you.

00:12:25.210 --> 00:12:27.290
While I'm in the demonkind territory,

00:12:27.290 --> 00:12:31.880
please use this herbicide and eradicate
those accursed bushgiller bastards.

00:12:31.880 --> 00:12:33.130
Roger that!

00:12:33.130 --> 00:12:34.380
I'm counting on you!

00:12:35.540 --> 00:12:37.170
So, what are you going to do?

00:12:37.540 --> 00:12:39.630
Are you going to arrange for a ship now?

00:12:39.830 --> 00:12:42.540
No, there's no time or money for that.

00:12:42.540 --> 00:12:44.630
In that case, the fastest way is to...

00:12:53.630 --> 00:12:55.880
Wait! Hey, wait!

00:12:55.880 --> 00:12:59.880
We'll sink! We'll drown!
You know, I can't swim!

00:12:59.880 --> 00:13:00.960
Don't worry!

00:13:00.960 --> 00:13:03.210
We'll sink if we stop, you know?!

00:13:03.210 --> 00:13:04.540
Please bear with it until we arrive!

00:13:04.540 --> 00:13:07.540
Oh no!

00:13:15.460 --> 00:13:16.920
You okay, Yuria?

00:13:17.460 --> 00:13:20.920
Uh... My head's still spinning...

00:13:20.920 --> 00:13:22.040
I'm sorry.

00:13:22.040 --> 00:13:23.880
It seemed like you were in a hurry, so...

00:13:23.880 --> 00:13:26.290
Oh no, I was scared, but...

00:13:26.710 --> 00:13:30.630
I'm okay if this means I can go save everyone,
even just a little bit sooner.

00:13:30.630 --> 00:13:32.040
Thank you, Onii-chan.

00:13:34.080 --> 00:13:35.080
Huh?

00:13:35.380 --> 00:13:37.080
Onii-chan, what's wrong?

00:13:37.210 --> 00:13:39.250
Oh, no. It's nothing.

00:13:39.630 --> 00:13:41.710
Well then, let's hurry and go.

00:13:41.710 --> 00:13:42.750
Okay!

00:13:59.250 --> 00:14:01.210
Oh! Volpe Dohma?

00:14:07.630 --> 00:14:09.710
Onii-chan, it's okay.

00:14:09.960 --> 00:14:13.580
Volpe Dohma is the one I talked about earlier
who takes care of me...

00:14:19.130 --> 00:14:19.920
Look out!

00:14:26.130 --> 00:14:30.130
Volpe Dohma?! What's wrong?!
It's me! It's Yuria!

00:14:45.000 --> 00:14:45.750
Over here!

00:14:50.880 --> 00:14:51.830
You idiot!

00:14:56.210 --> 00:14:59.420
Volpe Dohma?!
Why are you doing something like this?!

00:15:01.630 --> 00:15:04.920
This is... Someone may be controlling him!

00:15:43.880 --> 00:15:45.420
Yuria, you okay?

00:15:45.790 --> 00:15:46.880
Why?

00:15:46.880 --> 00:15:50.420
Volpe Dohma was always very kind, and yet...

00:15:51.210 --> 00:15:53.920
In any case, let's hurry on
to the Demon King Castle.

00:15:55.040 --> 00:15:55.920
Okay...

00:15:57.000 --> 00:15:58.790
Onii-chan, Volpe Dohma is...

00:16:03.460 --> 00:16:05.960
Get away from Yuria-sama...

00:16:06.500 --> 00:16:07.790
Volpe Dohma!

00:16:13.630 --> 00:16:16.540
Don't you lay a hand on my Al!

00:16:22.130 --> 00:16:24.500
Mom?! Why are you here?!

00:16:24.960 --> 00:16:27.580
I heard from Reaks, so I followed after you.

00:16:27.830 --> 00:16:28.960
Honestly...

00:16:28.960 --> 00:16:31.630
To charge into the demonkind territory by yourself.

00:16:31.630 --> 00:16:33.080
There's a limit to even recklessness, you know?

00:16:33.080 --> 00:16:35.080
S-sorry, Mom...

00:16:35.250 --> 00:16:39.420
But I'm glad that you're okay.
So, you're Yuria-chan, right?

00:16:39.750 --> 00:16:43.210
Nice to meet you. I'm Al's mother, Lucica.

00:16:46.580 --> 00:16:49.420
Oh dear, I've got a feeling
you don't like me, perhaps?

00:16:49.750 --> 00:16:50.960
Don't worry.

00:16:50.960 --> 00:16:55.500
All I did was knock him unconscious,
so he'll come to his senses once he wakes up.

00:16:56.460 --> 00:16:59.380
So, he was being controlled
by someone after all, huh?

00:16:59.790 --> 00:17:03.580
Still, Yuria, that demon is your attendant, right?

00:17:03.580 --> 00:17:05.920
His magic powers were off the charts, though...

00:17:05.920 --> 00:17:06.750
Yeah.

00:17:06.750 --> 00:17:10.420
Among the demonkind,
Volpe Dohma is the most powerful magic user,

00:17:10.420 --> 00:17:13.000
and he always stays by my side.

00:17:13.670 --> 00:17:16.540
He'll neatly fold my clothes...

00:17:18.250 --> 00:17:21.250
and he'll guard me all night long, and...

00:17:21.250 --> 00:17:22.500
Yuria-sama...

00:17:22.500 --> 00:17:25.830
I, Volpe Dohma, will keep watch
over you until morning...

00:17:27.790 --> 00:17:30.330
Let's see, also, things like taking a bath...

00:17:30.330 --> 00:17:33.880
Isn't it better if we keep a bastard
like that unconscious forever?

00:17:33.880 --> 00:17:34.880
I agree.

00:17:35.500 --> 00:17:39.630
But, for the moment,
let's leave him as is and hurry onward.

00:17:41.420 --> 00:17:43.130
Oh. Okay...

00:17:56.170 --> 00:17:57.420
No way...

00:18:03.420 --> 00:18:05.920
What... happened here?

00:18:07.380 --> 00:18:08.710
Oh! Wait!

00:18:09.830 --> 00:18:10.830
Are you okay?!

00:18:10.830 --> 00:18:11.960
What happened?!

00:18:17.830 --> 00:18:20.210
Just who would do this kind of thing?

00:18:23.250 --> 00:18:25.920
They most likely fought among themselves.

00:18:25.920 --> 00:18:30.130
Like the man from earlier,
maybe they were being controlled by someone.

00:18:34.750 --> 00:18:35.830
Yuria?!

00:18:38.000 --> 00:18:39.250
Father!

00:18:50.330 --> 00:18:52.250
Stay with me, Father!

00:18:55.540 --> 00:18:56.670
Father!

00:18:56.670 --> 00:18:59.250
It appears that he's just lost consciousness.

00:19:07.380 --> 00:19:09.000
Hey! You okay?!

00:19:11.880 --> 00:19:13.750
Wh-who're you...?

00:19:14.630 --> 00:19:18.290
Oh! Yuria-sama!
Thank goodness you're safe!

00:19:18.500 --> 00:19:21.330
Hey, take it easy. What happened?

00:19:21.330 --> 00:19:24.290
Th-that demon of a girl...

00:19:24.960 --> 00:19:26.790
Please get away, Yuria-sama!

00:19:27.250 --> 00:19:28.250
Huh?

00:19:33.380 --> 00:19:36.040
I'm sorry for this, Yuria-chan.

00:19:42.630 --> 00:19:44.000
Oh dear, Al...

00:19:44.000 --> 00:19:47.330
You shouldn't have gotten in my way...

00:19:53.580 --> 00:19:56.790
A bad child needs to be punished!

00:19:57.000 --> 00:20:00.040
You... are not my mom!

00:20:00.040 --> 00:20:02.080
What are you saying, Al?

00:20:02.080 --> 00:20:05.790
Who are you saying is your mother,
besides me?

00:20:06.040 --> 00:20:07.580
I already knew it.

00:20:07.960 --> 00:20:11.380
If you had been my real mom,
the moment you saw me,

00:20:11.750 --> 00:20:15.040
you would've come and hugged me
with enough force to break bones!

00:20:19.330 --> 00:20:21.670
Al! Al!

00:20:22.170 --> 00:20:24.380
I was waiting for you forever!

00:20:24.380 --> 00:20:26.330
I missed you!

00:20:26.330 --> 00:20:28.830
Al!

00:20:32.670 --> 00:20:35.380
Then, does that mean from the beginning...

00:20:35.540 --> 00:20:37.500
I was suspicious.

00:20:37.830 --> 00:20:40.880
But to be honest, I also wanted to believe.

00:20:46.040 --> 00:20:50.080
It's amazing that you saw
through my perfect disguise!

00:20:50.080 --> 00:20:52.250
You're not just an ordinary adventurer.

00:20:52.250 --> 00:20:53.130
As expected...

00:20:55.580 --> 00:20:58.210
Onii-chan, that's so you.

00:20:58.670 --> 00:20:59.500
Huh?

00:21:32.790 --> 00:21:34.080
How?

00:21:40.960 --> 00:21:43.210
Ilvia?

00:21:47.000 --> 00:21:48.630
It's been a long time...

00:21:48.920 --> 00:21:51.540
I missed you, Onii-chan.

00:21:56.330 --> 00:21:57.040
